{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23450","headline":"荅微之见寄 · 白居易","name":"荅微之见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"可怜风景浙东西，先数余杭次会稽。\n禹庙未胜天竺寺，钱湖不羡若耶溪。\n摆尘野鹤春毛暖，拍水沙鸥湿翅低。\n更对雪楼君爱否，红栏碧甃点银泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23450.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23450","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}